WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.873
This glossary gives you a compact review Do not
memorize every sentence

00:00:05.899 --> 00:00:11.424
exactly The important skill is being able to
distinguish the terms when

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:17.397
you encounter a new dataset If you can explain
structured versus semi-structured

00:00:17.594 --> 00:00:23.423
nominal versus ordinal interval versus ratio and
discrete versus continuous you have the conceptual

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:25.094
foundation for the next module
